---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import PageHeader from '../components/PageHeader.astro';
import LegalLayout from '../components/LegalLayout.astro';
---
<Layout
  title="Terms of Service — Preston East Solutions"
  description="The Terms of Service governing use of the prestoneastsolutions.com website and Preston East Solutions LLC services."
>
  <PageHeader label="Legal" title="Terms of Service" />
  <LegalLayout lastUpdated="June 2026">
    <p>
      These Terms of Service (“Terms”) govern your access to and use of
      <a href="https://prestoneastsolutions.com">prestoneastsolutions.com</a>
      and the services offered by <strong>Preston East Solutions LLC</strong>
      (“Preston East,” “we,” “us”). By using the site or engaging us, you
      agree to these Terms.
    </p>

    <h2>1. Services</h2>
    <p>We provide IT services including, but not limited to, cloud
    architecture, application development, QA and test automation, managed
    IT, cybersecurity and compliance, and fractional CTO advisory. The
    specifics of any engagement are governed by a separate written agreement
    or statement of work (“SOW”), which controls if it conflicts with these
    Terms.</p>

    <h2>2. Pricing &amp; payment</h2>
    <p>Tiered monthly plans (Foundation, Growth, Command) are month-to-month
    with a one-time setup fee billed at the start of the engagement. Setup
    fees are non-refundable once work begins. Monthly fees are billed per
    cycle, with <strong>14 days’ notice</strong> required to cancel a future
    cycle. Custom-scoped projects are billed per the applicable SOW.</p>

    <h2>3. Health Check</h2>
    <p>The Free IT Health Check is offered with no obligation to engage
    further. The 1-page report produced from the Health Check is yours to
    keep regardless of whether you hire us.</p>

    <h2>4. Outcomes guarantee</h2>
    <p>If we build something to written specification and it does not deliver
    to that specification, we will correct it at no additional cost. This
    guarantee does not cover changes in scope, third-party service issues
    outside our control, or items outside the documented spec.</p>

    <h2>5. Client responsibilities</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Provide timely access to systems, credentials, and stakeholders required to deliver the work.</li>
      <li>Notify us promptly of changes to scope or business priorities.</li>
      <li>Honor invoices according to the SOW or monthly cycle.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>6. Confidentiality</h2>
    <p>Information you share in the course of an engagement is treated as
    confidential. We do not disclose client identities or work product
    publicly without written consent. Mutual NDAs are available on request.</p>

    <h2>7. Intellectual property</h2>
    <p>Custom work delivered under a paid engagement is owned by the client
    upon full payment, subject to the terms of the SOW. We retain rights to
    underlying tools, libraries, frameworks, and general methodologies used
    to deliver the work.</p>

    <h2>8. Warranty &amp; limitation of liability</h2>
    <p>Except as expressly stated in an SOW or the outcomes guarantee above,
    services are provided “as is” without warranties of any kind. To the
    fullest extent permitted by law, our aggregate liability for any claim
    arising from or related to the services is limited to the fees paid in
    the three months preceding the claim. We are not liable for indirect,
    incidental, or consequential damages.</p>

    <h2>9. Indemnification</h2>
    <p>You agree to indemnify and hold Preston East harmless from claims
    arising out of your misuse of the services or your violation of these
    Terms.</p>

    <h2>10. Governing law</h2>
    <p>These Terms are governed by the laws of the State of Maryland,
    without regard to its conflict-of-laws principles. Exclusive jurisdiction
    and venue for any dispute will be in the state or federal courts located
    in Anne Arundel County, Maryland.</p>

    <h2>11. Changes</h2>
    <p>We may update these Terms from time to time. Material changes will be
    posted here with a revised “Last updated” date. Continued use of the
    site or services after changes take effect constitutes acceptance.</p>

    <h2>12. Contact</h2>
    <p>Questions about these Terms? Email
    <a href="mailto:info@prestoneastsolutions.com">info@prestoneastsolutions.com</a>
    or write to Preston East Solutions LLC, 1125 West St, Ste 200 #335,
    Annapolis, MD 21401.</p>
